WEBVTT

00:03:59.625 --> 00:04:01.309
For as long as she could remember,

00:04:01.333 --> 00:04:03.434
Grace had been hesitant to negotiate.

00:04:03.458 --> 00:04:07.101
GS: Being raised by Korean parents,

00:04:07.125 --> 00:04:09.851
from their perspective,
they're like, don't rock the boat.

00:04:09.875 --> 00:04:13.059
Like don't jeopardize that.

00:04:13.083 --> 00:04:15.893
Just be appreciative
of getting that steady paycheck

00:04:15.917 --> 00:04:17.518
and be grateful for what you get.

00:04:17.542 --> 00:04:20.958
So I think that was
the mentality that I had.

00:04:21.731 --> 00:04:23.684
AG: It became clear that Grace was buying

00:04:23.708 --> 00:04:25.643
into some common myths about negotiating

00:04:25.667 --> 00:04:29.000
which made it seem like results
and relationships had to be either or.

00:04:29.958 --> 00:04:31.934
After her six years of being underpaid,